<.email_layout variant="preview" subject="Seu resumo de outubro" brand="Ledgerly" title="Seu resumo de outubro">
  <:body>
    <p class="lu-ink2" style="margin:0">
      Oi Ikram, o MRR cresceu <b>8,8%</b> e chegou a <b>$184,320</b>. Três insights novos esperam por você.
    </p>
    <div class="lu-grid" style="--cols:3;gap:10px">
      <div style="background:var(--bg-tray);border-radius:12px;padding:12px">
        <div class="lu-xs lu-muted">MRR</div>
        <b class="num" style="font-size:20px">$184.3k</b>
        <div><span class="lu-delta up">8.8%</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--bg-tray);border-radius:12px;padding:12px">
        <div class="lu-xs lu-muted">Churn</div>
        <b class="num" style="font-size:20px">2.1%</b>
        <div><span class="lu-delta bad-up">0.4 pts</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:var(--bg-tray);border-radius:12px;padding:12px">
        <div class="lu-xs lu-muted">NRR</div>
        <b class="num" style="font-size:20px">108%</b>
        <div><span class="lu-delta up">2 pts</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </:body>
  <:action href="#">Abrir dashboard</:action>
  <:footer>
    Você recebe este e-mail porque é admin do workspace Orbit Cloud. <a href="#" style="color:inherit">Gerenciar alertas</a>
  </:footer>
</.email_layout>
